            ['start_time' => 609.52, 'end_time' => 618.07, 'target_text' => 'and forbade any hand to withhold meat from man or beast. Thus by Allah\'s decree, Abdullah was', 'source_text' => 'dan melarang sesiapa pun daripada menghalang dagingnya diambil oleh manusia mahupun binatang. Maka dengan ketetapan Allah, terselamatlah Abdullah,', 'order' => 71],
